{"3205020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Coven: All Powerful", "steam_appid": 3205020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Coven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends (or make new rivals) and dive into a world where magic is unpredictable, the rules don’t stay the same for long, and every match turns into absolute chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Sage, pick your spells, and get ready—because no two rounds ever play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/84f3a7e4a9df5a9e55d8bedd04b678a4.avif?t=1787967573\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras_big/84f3a7e4a9df5a9e55d8bedd04b678a4.avif?t=1787967573 width=1560 height=878 /></span>✨ <strong>Magical Mayhem, Every Round</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just a fight—it’s a constantly shifting magical playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, players unleash <strong>Enchantments</strong>—wild modifiers that bend the rules of the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn tornadoes, fog, or explosive chaos across the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip buffs into curses (or steal them entirely)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the battlefield into something completely unrecognizable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack enough of them, and things get <i>gloriously out of control</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.poster.avif?t=1787967573\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.webm?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.mp4?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎉 <strong>Built for Party Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into fast-paced matches where anything can happen:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3v3 team brawls full of spell spam and clutch moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 duels for pure bragging rights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-For-All madness where alliances last about 3 seconds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re playing casually or yelling at your friends in Discord, every match is designed for laughs, surprises, and “WAIT—WHAT JUST HAPPENED?!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔮 <strong>Ridiculous Spell Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Sage brings their own flavor of chaos:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch enemies into traps, explosions, or other players’ spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain abilities together in ways that feel <i>borderline unfair</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the tide instantly with a perfectly (or accidentally) timed cast</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to jump into, endlessly fun to mess around with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 <strong>Whimsical, Ever-Changing Realms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across floating arenas bursting with personality:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystalline caverns, haunted necropolises, enchanted forests, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive elements, shifting hazards, and magical surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for constant movement, chaos, and “how did I survive that?” moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.poster.avif?t=1787967573\" width=360 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.webm?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.mp4?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ <strong>Fast Matches, Big Energy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long waits. No slow build-up.<br>Just jump in and go:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick rounds that keep the momentum high</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant respawns and constant action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for “one more match”… over and over again</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 <strong>Experiment, Adapt, Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is great—but half the fun is just seeing what happens:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try new Sage + Enchantment combos every match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the chaos instead of controlling it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ridiculous interactions you didn’t even plan</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.poster.avif?t=1787967573\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.webm?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.mp4?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>The Battlefield Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing to win, playing to troll, or just playing to cause absolute magical nonsense—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There’s always another wild moment waiting in the next round.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So grab your Sage, step into the Realm, and embrace the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Coven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends (or make new rivals) and dive into a world where magic is unpredictable, the rules don’t stay the same for long, and every match turns into absolute chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Sage, pick your spells, and get ready—because no two rounds ever play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/84f3a7e4a9df5a9e55d8bedd04b678a4.avif?t=1787967573\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras_big/84f3a7e4a9df5a9e55d8bedd04b678a4.avif?t=1787967573 width=1560 height=878 /></span>✨ <strong>Magical Mayhem, Every Round</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just a fight—it’s a constantly shifting magical playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, players unleash <strong>Enchantments</strong>—wild modifiers that bend the rules of the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn tornadoes, fog, or explosive chaos across the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip buffs into curses (or steal them entirely)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the battlefield into something completely unrecognizable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack enough of them, and things get <i>gloriously out of control</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.poster.avif?t=1787967573\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.webm?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.mp4?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎉 <strong>Built for Party Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into fast-paced matches where anything can happen:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3v3 team brawls full of spell spam and clutch moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 duels for pure bragging rights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-For-All madness where alliances last about 3 seconds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re playing casually or yelling at your friends in Discord, every match is designed for laughs, surprises, and “WAIT—WHAT JUST HAPPENED?!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔮 <strong>Ridiculous Spell Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Sage brings their own flavor of chaos:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch enemies into traps, explosions, or other players’ spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain abilities together in ways that feel <i>borderline unfair</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the tide instantly with a perfectly (or accidentally) timed cast</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to jump into, endlessly fun to mess around with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 <strong>Whimsical, Ever-Changing Realms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across floating arenas bursting with personality:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystalline caverns, haunted necropolises, enchanted forests, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive elements, shifting hazards, and magical surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for constant movement, chaos, and “how did I survive that?” moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.poster.avif?t=1787967573\" width=360 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.webm?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.mp4?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ <strong>Fast Matches, Big Energy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long waits. No slow build-up.<br>Just jump in and go:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick rounds that keep the momentum high</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant respawns and constant action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for “one more match”… over and over again</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 <strong>Experiment, Adapt, Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is great—but half the fun is just seeing what happens:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try new Sage + Enchantment combos every match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the chaos instead of controlling it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ridiculous interactions you didn’t even plan</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.poster.avif?t=1787967573\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.webm?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.mp4?t=1787967573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>The Battlefield Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing to win, playing to troll, or just playing to cause absolute magical nonsense—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There’s always another wild moment waiting in the next round.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So grab your Sage, step into the Realm, and embrace the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A chaotic spell-slinging party brawler where Sages clash in ever-changing magical realms. Stack wild enchantments, unleash devastating spells and combos, and outlast your friends in fast, unpredictable battles full of pure arcane mayhem.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/5ba0908f61867a9ff080499ad8d12d743923c1bc/header.jpg?t=1787967573", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/f13c1